// libuv 1.53.0 (conan-center-index recipes/libuv). Every clause cites
// include/uv.h (and include/uv/unix.h / include/uv/win.h) installed by the package.
//
// Raw functions (genuinely unmodeled/unsafe by nature):
// - uv_replace_allocator: replaces process-global C allocator function pointers.
// - uv_default_loop, uv_loop_new, uv_loop_delete: process-global singleton or
//   deprecated allocator-backed loop APIs (use Loop.init()).
// - uv_loop_configure: C variadic option API.
// - uv_handle_get_data, uv_handle_set_data, uv_req_get_data, uv_req_set_data,
//   uv_loop_get_data, uv_loop_set_data, uv_key_get, uv_key_set, uv_fs_get_ptr:
//   untyped `void *` user-data accessors.
// - uv_walk, uv_print_all_handles, uv_print_active_handles: untyped `void *`
//   or raw C `FILE *` diagnostics.
// - uv_spawn, uv_queue_work, uv_getaddrinfo, uv_getnameinfo, uv_random,
//   uv_thread_create*, uv_dlopen, uv_dlsym, uv_once, uv_setup_args:
//   untyped `void *` / `char **` / cross-thread C callback entry points or
//   dynamic symbol loading.
// - uv_cpu_info, uv_interface_addresses, uv_os_environ, uv_os_get_passwd*,
//   uv_os_get_group: pointer-to-array-of-structs with count-paired custom free.
// - uv_metrics_info: `uv_metrics_t` contains `uint64_t* reserved[13]` (pointer-holding record).
// - uv_utf16_to_wtf8, uv_wtf8_to_utf16: raw UTF-16 `uint16_t *` buffers.
